OL,3,GNEWSAPark homes plans thrown out due to
OL,4,Aflood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build homes on a field
OL,7,Fconsidered "highly vulnerable" to
OL,8,Fflooding have been thrown out by
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FA developer had asked for permission to
OL,12,Fbuild 31 lodges, or park homes, and a
OL,13,Fsocial hub on the land near Thorne in
OL,14,FDoncaster.
OL,16,FBut councillors at City of Doncaster
OL,17,FCouncil said they were not convinced by
OL,18,FWPS Developments' assertion that the
OL,19,Fflood zone maps were "inaccurate" and
OL,20,Fthe Environment Agency's objections
OL,21,Fwere therefore flawed.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
