OL,3,GNEWSAPark homes plans thrown out due to
OL,4,Aflood risk
OL,5,
OL,6,FLea Favill, who spoke in support of the
OL,7,Fapplication to switch the land from
OL,8,Fagricultural to residential use, told
OL,9,Fmembers he "would be absolutely amazed
OL,10,Fif this site floods".
